</p></caption><media xlink:href="ACN3-12-2271-s001.zip"/></supplementary-material></sec></body><back><ack id="acn370135-sec-0027"><title>Acknowledgements</title><p>The authors would like to thank the patients for their participation in the study and the biological resource center for biobanking CHU Nantes, H&#x000f4;tel Dieu, Centre de ressources biologiques (CRB), Nantes, F&#x02010;44093, France (BRIF: BB&#x02010;0033&#x02010;00040).</p></ack><sec sec-type="data-availability" id="acn370135-sec-0029"><title>Data Availability Statement</title><p>The data that support the findings of this study are available from the corresponding author upon reasonable request.</p></sec><ref-list content-type="cited-references" id="acn370135-bibl-0001"><title>References</title><ref id="acn370135-bib-0001"><label>1</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal" id="acn370135-cit-0001">
